        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Route by path, cache the slow report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;/users/ goes to users-service with X-Forwarded-For and X-Forwarded-Proto. /users/report is cached for 20 s.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry y="164" width="600" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enforce gateway policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;/orders/ needs an X-API-Key (401 without it) and allows 2 requests/s plus a burst of 3 per key, then 429.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry y="246" width="600" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Capture both hops&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;The sniffer shares the proxy&amp;#x27;s network namespace: TLS records on :8443, clear-text HTTP on :5000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry y="328" width="600" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Leave through the forward proxy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;The corporate network has no route out. Squid blocks .games.example.test (403), logs every request and caches eligible HTTP responses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry y="410" width="600" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" value="6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reach the website&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;The site sees Squid&amp;#x27;s address. Over HTTP Squid adds X-Forwarded-For and Via; over HTTPS it only tunnels with CONNECT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry y="492" width="600" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" value="7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cross both proxies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;CONNECT to shop.example.test:8443 reaches nginx, which sees Squid, not the workstation, as its client.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" width="548" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not a load balancer lab&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Each path goes to a different service, one instance each. Algorithms, health checks and failover are Lab 03 (HAProxy).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Here the proxy adds TLS, caching, keys, rate limits and forwarding headers, and Squid shows the client side.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fillColor=light-dark(#F5F5F5,#29393B);strokeColor=#666666;fillStyle=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="710" width="610" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>